---
// HowItWorks.astro - Paso a paso minimalista
---

<section class="section how-it-works-section" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-tag">Fácil y Rápido</span>
      <h2>¿Cómo funciona Rutea en 3 simples pasos?</h2>
      <p>
        Sin complicaciones. Diseñado para que en menos de 2 minutos tengas tu viaje coordinado.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number-badge">1</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrapper">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
            <line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Busca o Publica</h3>
        <p>
          Ingresa origen, destino costero o urbano y horario. Si vas en tu auto, publica los asientos que no utilizas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Connector line -->
      <div class="step-divider" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number-badge">2</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrapper">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M14 9V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3l-4 9v11h11.28a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.7l1.38-9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2.3zM7 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Reserva con Confianza</h3>
        <p>
          Revisa el perfil, valoraciones y vehículo verificado del conductor. Confirma tu cupo instantáneamente.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Connector line -->
      <div class="step-divider" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number-badge">3</div>
        <div class="step-icon-wrapper">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path>
            <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Viaja Fresco y Comparte</h3>
        <p>
          Encuéntrate en el punto acordado, viaja con comodidad, paga de forma transparente y califica tu experiencia.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works-section {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    position: relative;
  }

  .steps-grid {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step-card {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2.2rem 1.8rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-sand-light);
    border: 1px solid rgba(11, 93, 103, 0.1);
    position: relative;
    transition: transform var(--transition-normal);
  }

  .step-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--color-seafoam);
  }

  .step-number-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    left: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-ocean);
    background: #FFFFFF;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-seafoam);
  }

  .step-icon-wrapper {
    width: 68px;
    height: 68px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(143, 214, 200, 0.3) 0%, rgba(15, 138, 139, 0.15) 100%);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-seafoam-border);
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-slate);
  }

  .step-card p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--color-slate-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .step-divider {
    color: var(--color-seafoam);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .steps-grid {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .step-divider {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
    }
    .step-card {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
